-#### Evidence Assessment
-The post is commentary (E5) that cites incident reporting and podcasts rather than presenting original data. Technical claims have moderate support; broad claims about “AI” and corporate culture are interpretive.
+Doctorow offers commentary. The strongest comparison is between two vantage points on **one** event: METR had access to the evaluation investigation; Hugging Face observed the intrusion. The RubyHack and Collusion.wiki summaries are leads without their underlying artifacts. Anthropic can observe activity on its own platform, but detected misuse is not a sample of all deployments or all attackers.
 
